abstract: >
  A QGIS plugin that enables dynamic visualization of paleo sea level changes
  by adjusting styling on raster bathymetry/topography layers based on sea level
  curves. Allows users to explore how coastal environments changed through
  geological time, produce animated maps, and compute spatial indices such as
  subaerial exposure duration and shoreline persistence.
